      "description": "Authored C# source text or files, compiled semantically into the same native module contract. Data declarations and typed static server/service methods use ordinary C# expressions, calls and structured control flow. Public methods require authentication; Authorize declares roles. Unsupported constructs report source diagnostics. IDataSession translates typed CRUD and basic LINQ queries. Paging, joins/projections, mutable reference effects, async and general .NET APIs remain incomplete. No jobs, graphs or native bindings are supplied by the author."
     },
